character_oldMan (Negative): I ain't listenin' to no more beeswax. Now hurry up and get outta here before I blast you's and your sorry excuse of a shack.... ta SMITHEREENS!!
character_oldMan (Negative): CAPICHE!! GOT IT!? NOW GET ON OUTTA HERE! GIT!
character_oldMan: Huh!? What'd you's say? Alchemy academy graduate? Top o' da class?
character_oldMan: Den what's you's doin' all the way out 'ere?
character_oldMan: Hmmm. Let's see here. I's got it.
character_oldMan (Positive): IF. What you're sayin' is true. Dis' MAGNANIMOUS GODMAN DAVE and dis' Land o' mine could use your skills.
character_oldMan: Plenty of folk round 'ere have need of some concotions.
character_oldMan: Dunno why you's decided to set up shop here but let's say what you's said was the truth.
